[312.29117, "o", "sing device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\npartials-only SPLIT=16 BLOCK=4096 w=4 st=5 mean=102.2us min=101.1us\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm-only SPLIT=16 BLOCK=4096 w=8 st=3 mean=211.9us min=209.6us\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm-only SPLIT=16 BLOCK=4096 w=8 st=5 mean=212.2us min=210.0us\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm-only SPLIT=16 BLOCK=8192 w=8 st=5 mean=208.4us min=207.3us\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm-only SPLIT=16 BLOCK=16384 w=16 st=4 mean=220.0us min=219.1us\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm-only SPLIT=32 BLOCK=4096 w=8 st=5 mean=228.4us min=225.2us\r\n"]
