[394.993225, "o", " w=8 st=3 ok=True clear: mean=219.2 min=215.5 | clean: mean=234.6 min=230.6\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm SPLIT=32 BLOCK=2048 w=4 st=4 ok=True clear: mean=214.9 min=210.7 | clean: mean=228.0 min=223.0\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm SPLIT=16 BLOCK=4096 w=8 st=3 ok=True clear: mean=213.0 min=209.6 | clean: mean=228.2 min=224.1\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\nnorm SPLIT=8 BLOCK=8192 w=8 st=4 ok=True clear: mean=256.1 min=251.4 | clean: mean=269.0 min=266.1\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\npair SPLIT=16 BLOCK=4096 w=8 st=4 ok=True clear: mean=317.1 min=302.9 | clean: mean=314.7 min=311.7\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 10\r\npair SPLIT=16 BLOCK=8192 w=8 st=4 ok=True clear: mean=314.0 min=299.0 | clean: mean=310.2 min=305.1\r\n[Profiling] Using device: cuda NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3"]
